      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Doorstep Delivery Handover, Inventory Verification &amp; Placement at Kharagpur</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>At Kharagpur, the final delivery and uncrating procedure is a meticulous, step‑by‑step process that guarantees the integrity of every item and the safety of the installation site. The first checkpoint is the daylight delivery verification.</p>
<p>Upon arrival, the delivery crew immediately cross‑checks the goods against the original inventory bilty – the signed delivery document that lists item numbers, serials, and condition notes. Any discrepancies are logged on a mobile tablet and a duplicate bilty is issued to the client for their records.</p>

<p>Next, the uncrating zone is prepared. A clean, dust‑free floor is marked with color‑coded tape: one section for fragile electronics, another for heavy furniture, and a third for consumable packing materials. The crew uses padded gloves and anti‑static wrist straps when handling electrical and mechanical components to avoid static discharge and physical damage.</p>

