    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Testing Electrical/Mechanical Items:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Each device is powered on in a controlled environment. For electronics, voltage, current, and functionality are checked against the manufacturer’s specifications. For mechanical items such as air‑conditioners or HVAC units, airflow, pressure, and operational noise are measured.</p>
