    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Clean Furniture Placement:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Furniture is placed on pre‑marked floor plans that align with the client’s layout diagram. The team ensures that all legs, joints, and upholstery are free of damage. Any required adjustments are noted, and a quick visual inspection is performed to confirm that the placement meets the agreed aesthetics.</p>
