    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Swift Removal of Packing Debris:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Once all items are verified, the crew immediately removes all packing materials. They use high‑capacity dustbins for cardboard, a recycling bin for plastic wraps, and a bio‑hazard container for any used oil or coolant. The site is then swept with a HEPA‑filtered vacuum to eliminate fine particles, leaving a pristine environment ready for the client’s use.</p>
